{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"生象的范畴"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Ani"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"<p>生象的范畴 $\\mathsf{Ani}$ 是最基本的 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Ani}$ 是一个点在"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":"下自由生成的范畴.</p>\n<h3>带基点对象</h3>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Ani}$ 的终对象 $*$ 下的"},{"Local":{"url":"仰范畴","text":"仰范畴"}},{"Plain":"称为<strong>带基点生象</strong>的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani_pt","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}_*$"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}